---
source: lib/libui/bottom_pane/footer.rs
expression: "render_test_backend_debug(width, height, |f|\n{\n    draw_footer(Rect::new(0, 0, f.area().width, height), f.buffer_mut(),\n    props, collaboration_mode_indicator,);\n})"
---
"  / for commands                             ! for shell commands               "
"  shift + enter for newline                  tab to queue message               "
"  @ for file paths                           ctrl + v to paste images           "
"  ctrl + g to edit in external editor        esc again to edit previous message "
"  ctrl + c to exit                                                              "
"  ctrl + t to view transcript                ctrl + o to view logs              "
"  ctrl + l to clear screen (idle)            ctrl + p to cycle permissions      "
"  Agents (empty draft; no popup)                                                "
"  ⌥ + ← previous agent        ⌥ + → next agent                                  "
"  Panes (multiple panes open; no popup)                                         "
"  ⌥ + h/j/k/l focus ←/↓/↑/→        shift + ⌥ + h/j/k/l resize panes             "
"  ⌥ + enter cycle focus            ⌥ + q close one pane                         "
"  ⌥ + w close all panes                                                         "
"  Full reference: man/chaos-keyboard.7.md                                       "
